绵密的完美口感，咬下去“咔嚓”一声……那是艺术！而且薯条的包容性有多强？它可以搭配番茄酱、蛋黄酱、芝士酱，甚至是冰淇淋！炸鸡能做到吗？它太霸道，太单一了！\nSpeaker 2: 哇，等一下。艺术？你管一根美化过的土豆条叫‘艺术’？太荒谬了。炸鸡才是真正的杰作。它是一种完整的感官体验。你有酥脆的外皮，里面是多汁鲜嫩的鸡肉，还有香料和草药混合出的复杂风味……它是一顿正餐！分量十足！薯条不过是个配菜。它们只是开场表演。炸鸡才是主菜，是压轴大戏。薯条需要酱料才变得有趣；而一块完美的炸鸡，除了它本身什么都不需要。", false, "sdpa", 1.3, 10, 997573396881122, "randomize", true, 0.95, 0.95, 0, true], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "speaker_1_voice", "link": 13, "label": "speaker_1_voice", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "speaker_1_voice"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "speaker_2_voice", "link": 12, "label": "speaker_2_voice", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "speaker_2_voice"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "speaker_3_voice", "label": "speaker_3_voice", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "speaker_3_voice"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "speaker_4_voice", "label": "speaker_4_voice", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "speaker_4_voice"}, {"widget": {"name": "model_name"}, "name": "model_name", "label": "model_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}, {"widget": {"name": "quantize_llm_4bit"}, "name": "quantize_llm_4bit", "label": "quantize_llm_4bit", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "quantize_llm_4bit"}, {"widget": {"name": "attention_mode"}, "name": "attention_mode", "label": "attention_mode", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "attention_mode"}, {"widget": {"name": "cfg_scale"}, "name": "cfg_scale", "label": "cfg_scale", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "cfg_scale"}, {"widget": {"name": "inference_steps"}, "name": "inference_steps", "label": "inference_steps", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "inference_steps"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "do_sample"}, "name": "do_sample", "label": "do_sample", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "do_sample"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "